      "His greatest victory: the demon Vritra had blocked all rivers and rain, causing drought and death across the earth. Indra alone could fight him — but his previous Vajra had been destroyed. The sage Dadhichi, when approached, offered the most extraordinary gift: he gave his own bones. Dadhichi dissolved his body through yoga, and from his spine the divine architect Vishwakarma fashioned the new Vajra. Indra slew Vritra with this weapon made from a sage's sacrifice and released the waters of the world.",
